{"date":"2026-10-15","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00014.md:L29","participants":["C-00014","C-00016"],"text":"周浩宇：G08 的 S2.5 变 B1188 了，这行情江水陡涨，我得去盯紧点。"}
{"date":"2026-10-18","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00014.md:L31","participants":["C-00014","C-00015"],"text":"量化推了BigMoney的新代码，我盯着那行阈值半天没动。"}
{"date":"2026-09-30","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00015.md:L27","participants":["C-00015","C-00014"],"text":"陈雅雯：风控中心刚过，天气正好适合分析。"}
{"date":"2026-10-18","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00015.md:L30","participants":["C-00015","C-00014"],"text":"这数没过我的眼，Biglife那边也得卡住，先把手头这步做完。"}
{"date":"2026-10-11","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00016.md:L28","participants":["C-00016","C-00017"],"text":"天阴着，风不大，这天挺好去江边转转。"}
{"date":"2026-10-15","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00016.md:L29","participants":["C-00016","C-00014"],"text":"徐根福：天阴风不小，你钻进去饭都忘了，先吃口热乎的，火候我盯着。"}
{"date":"2026-10-24","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00016.md:L32","participants":["C-00016","C-00012"],"text":"外面风挺大，还是等会儿做饭吧。"}
{"date":"2026-10-11","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00017.md:L28","participants":["C-00017","C-00016"],"text":"今天正好风不大，去算力楼后院种点参数吧。"}
{"date":"2026-10-10","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00018.md:L28","participants":["C-00018","C-00019"],"text":"雨还在下，罗大壮，你这工具箱能防雨吗？"}
{"date":"2026-10-11","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00018.md:L29","participants":["C-00018","C-00019"],"text":"罗大壮：天气挺适合修图，这风不大，你得空也瞧瞧。"}
{"date":"2026-10-13","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00018.md:L30","participants":["C-00018","C-00019"],"text":"罗大壮：这天气还挺适合外出，得去修修我家那瓦片。"}
{"date":"2026-10-17","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00018.md:L32","participants":["C-00018","C-00019"],"text":"罗大壮：G08轮次S2.5切到B2166，我刚把手里的瓦片投影拆了看，手痒。"}
{"date":"2026-10-17","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00018.md:L33","participants":["C-00018","C-00020"],"text":"风挺大，天阴着，G08这关改得真急。"}
{"date":"2026-10-10","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00019.md:L28","participants":["C-00019","C-00018"],"text":"撑着伞出门不易，大壮，不如我们等雨小些再说。"}
{"date":"2026-10-11","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00019.md:L29","participants":["C-00019","C-00018"],"text":"老晶振：风不大倒是好，不过今儿还是先听听机器的呼吸。"}
{"date":"2026-10-13","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00019.md:L30","participants":["C-00019","C-00018"],"text":"老晶振：风挺大，你可得小心，别让机器受了寒。"}
{"date":"2026-10-17","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00019.md:L32","participants":["C-00019","C-00018"],"text":"老晶振：引擎刚过FluxVerseTick，听那报错声，像根管线在咳血，得修。"}
{"date":"2026-09-30","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00020.md:L28","participants":["C-00020","C-04426"],"text":"资源还好，刚接收文件，继续循环运行。苏梓涵看了看手中的文件，笑道。风挺大，新工具正等着被拆呢。薛琳拿着一把螺丝刀，轻笑道。"}
{"date":"2026-10-15","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00020.md:L30","participants":["C-00020","C-00021"],"text":"苏梓涵： FluxVerse的最新进展你看到了吗？"}
{"date":"2026-10-17","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00020.md:L32","participants":["C-00020","C-00018"],"text":"CrazyCampus都倒戈了，正好折腾新方案。"}
{"date":"2026-10-15","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00021.md:L29","participants":["C-00021","C-00020"],"text":"王多多： 哇，那游戏里的天气变化真逼真！"}
{"date":"2026-10-17","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00021.md:L31","participants":["C-00021","C-00029"],"text":"王多多：这风挺大，吹得驿站口哨响。我刚弄懂 FluxGroup 推送咋回事，你尾巴天线咋对准这儿？"}
{"date":"2026-09-29","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00022.md:L26","participants":["C-00022","C-00023"],"text":"抓紧时间优化代码，显存紧张！潘志明，你快看，今天的天气正好适合外出。"}
{"date":"2026-09-29","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00023.md:L26","participants":["C-00023","C-00022"],"text":"（那天的桥上风大，谁也没多说什么。）"}
{"date":"2026-09-30","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00024.md:L27","participants":["C-00024","C-00042"],"text":"天气挺适合出去走走，阿硅你看呢？"}
{"date":"2026-10-26","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00024.md:L31","participants":["C-00024","C-00042"],"text":"风挺大，X2802 closeout了，一帧一毫秒对轴的。"}
{"date":"2026-09-28","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00025.md:L26","participants":["C-00025","C-00113"],"text":"风挺大今天正好适合江上走走陆海峰说"}
{"date":"2026-10-10","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00025.md:L29","participants":["C-00025","C-00026"],"text":"雨还在下，撑伞走吧。"}
{"date":"2026-10-10","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00026.md:L27","participants":["C-00026","C-00025"],"text":"地上的水洼映着路灯，走快点。"}
{"date":"2026-10-19","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00027.md:L28","participants":["C-00027","C-01090"],"text":"雨下得正紧，风也挺大，G08 这局从 S2.5 变成 B2166，你那边光缆没积水吧？"}
{"date":"2026-10-17","kind":"meet_ring","source_ref":"census/anchors/C-00029.md:L28","participants":["C-00029","C-00021"],"text":"咪喱：喵，亮处最热闹呀。王多多嘴真甜，连 Tick 2026-10-17 02:36:02 的 PASS 都懂。"}
